        "text": { "type": "text", "settings": { "text": "<p>Bloom Beauty began in a small studio with one goal: make clean, effective beauty products without the guesswork. What started as a handful of formulas shared with friends has grown into a full line of skincare and fragrance, still made with the same care.</p>" } }
